### Repair Management — Stage 4 API examples
### Requires: Stage 1 MySQL/Flyway, Stage 2 user/company and Stage 3 inventory.
### In IntelliJ .http, replace IDs with actual API response values.
### Use HTTP Basic Auth for LOCAL TESTING ONLY (project has no JWT yet).

@base = http://localhost:8081
@companyId = 1
@itemId = 1
@orderId = 1
@customerEmail = customer@example.com
@customerPassword = DemoPassword123!
@managerEmail = owner@example.com
@managerPassword = DemoPassword123!

### 1. Register a customer (run once)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"fullName":"Customer Test","email":"{{customerEmail}}","password":"{{customerPassword}}"}

### 2. Browse publicly
GET {{base}}/api/companies/{{companyId}}/items

### 3. Add 2 items to own cart. PUT means set exact quantity (not increment).
PUT {{base}}/api/companies/{{companyId}}/cart/items/{{itemId}}
Authorization: Basic {{customerEmail}} {{customerPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"quantity": 2}

### 4. View cart, current selling prices only
GET {{base}}/api/companies/{{companyId}}/cart
Authorization: Basic {{customerEmail}} {{customerPassword}}

### 5. Checkout — atomic; creates CONFIRMED order and stock movements
POST {{base}}/api/companies/{{companyId}}/checkout
Authorization: Basic {{customerEmail}} {{customerPassword}}

### 6. View customer order history
GET {{base}}/api/companies/{{companyId}}/orders/mine
Authorization: Basic {{customerEmail}} {{customerPassword}}

### 7. Managers can see all company orders
GET {{base}}/api/companies/{{companyId}}/orders
Authorization: Basic {{managerEmail}} {{managerPassword}}

### 8. Manager confirms fulfillment (NOT proof of payment)
POST {{base}}/api/companies/{{companyId}}/orders/{{orderId}}/complete
Authorization: Basic {{managerEmail}} {{managerPassword}}

### 9. Completed-orders gross profit (not net profit)
GET {{base}}/api/companies/{{companyId}}/finance/sales-summary
Authorization: Basic {{managerEmail}} {{managerPassword}}

### ALTERNATIVE to step 8: cancel a DIFFERENT confirmed order before completion
### Cancellation restocks and cannot be run again on same order.
POST {{base}}/api/companies/{{companyId}}/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel
Authorization: Basic {{customerEmail}} {{customerPassword}}

### 10. Remove from cart (use before checkout to test)
DELETE {{base}}/api/companies/{{companyId}}/cart/items/{{itemId}}
Authorization: Basic {{customerEmail}} {{customerPassword}}
